@context: Pages that are slow — what waits on its own, and how to wait for the rest.
@title: waiting

@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000

STEP 1: VERIFY already waits
    NAVIGATE to {site}/dynamic.html
    # 'Report ready' appears 1.5 s after the click. VERIFY keeps looking until
    # the timeout (5 s by default, --timeout to change), so no WAIT is needed.
    CLICK the 'Build report' button
    VERIFY that 'Report ready: 3 orders' is present

STEP 2: Wait for something to go away
    WAIT FOR 'Loading page...' to disappear
    CLICK the 'Save settings' button
    WAIT FOR 'Settings saved' to be visible
    WAIT FOR 'Settings saved' to disappear

STEP 3: A fixed pause, when nothing on the page says "done"
    WAIT 0.5

DONE.
